LWC trap: exam asks WHEN to use each decorator, not the definition.

@wire = pull data from Salesforce
@api = passed in from parent
@track = reactive local state

Know the use case. That's what scores points.

if you're brand new to Salesforce:

Admin. full stop.

Every other cert assumes you know profiles, OWD, validation rules. Skipping Admin is like skipping grammar to study literature — it just takes twice as long.
